      "repair_reason": "- [P2] No narrow mechanical repair remains; a routing-area reviewer should confirm the refreshed required checks and decide whether to merge.; Cleared: The two-file diff changes only in-process route-cache key encoding and regression tests; it adds no dependency, workflow, secret, permission, artifact-download, or supply-chain surface. (sha=35490e76473a575dc5bdcf1631a983dfac05b49c)",
